; Explicit rescaling, additive solving and nonzero lambda cancellation
; for FLT/Three.lean:640-656. The common lambda is cancelled using
; its proved nonzero certificate; no normalized cubic equation or
; cancellation oracle is accepted as a premise.
(#alias eisenstein = ./eisenstein-defs.lim::eisenstein)
